Subject: [PATCH] ArmVirtPkg: add PciSioSerialDxe to ArmVirtQemu

Add MdeModulePkg's PciSioSerialDxe to ArmVirtQemu (DSC and FDF), so a
16550 UART behind PCI, such as QEMU's pci-serial device on virt, gets
an EFI_SERIAL_IO_PROTOCOL beside the PL011's. OvmfPkgX64 already
builds it. The console is unchanged: the platform boot manager
(PlatformBootManagerLibLight) adds only the PL011 and virtio serial
devices to ConIn, ConOut and ErrOut, so the new port is a console only
when a ConIn, ConOut or ErrOut variable names it.

axl-firmware's patch against edk2-stable202611, applied after
0004-terminal-control-keys.patch to a copy of the packages it touches.

---
diff --git a/ArmVirtPkg/ArmVirtQemu.dsc b/ArmVirtPkg/ArmVirtQemu.dsc
index bf27866..7967906 100644
--- a/ArmVirtPkg/ArmVirtQemu.dsc
+++ b/ArmVirtPkg/ArmVirtQemu.dsc
@@ -411,6 +411,7 @@
   # PCI support
   #
   MdeModulePkg/Bus/Pci/PciHostBridgeDxe/PciHostBridgeDxe.inf
+  MdeModulePkg/Bus/Pci/PciSioSerialDxe/PciSioSerialDxe.inf
 
   #
   # Video support
diff --git a/ArmVirtPkg/ArmVirtQemuFvMain.fdf.inc b/ArmVirtPkg/ArmVirtQemuFvMain.fdf.inc
index 6379116..2fb9dd5 100644
--- a/ArmVirtPkg/ArmVirtQemuFvMain.fdf.inc
+++ b/ArmVirtPkg/ArmVirtQemuFvMain.fdf.inc
@@ -184,6 +184,7 @@ READ_LOCK_STATUS   = TRUE
   INF OvmfPkg/PciHotPlugInitDxe/PciHotPlugInit.inf
   INF OvmfPkg/VirtioPciDeviceDxe/VirtioPciDeviceDxe.inf
   INF OvmfPkg/Virtio10Dxe/Virtio10.inf
+  INF MdeModulePkg/Bus/Pci/PciSioSerialDxe/PciSioSerialDxe.inf
 
   #
   # Video support
